sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Admin as Cluster Admin
    participant CLI as rhai-cli<br/>(workstation / container)
    participant API as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Trusty as TrustyAI Service Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2
    participant GH as raw.githubusercontent.com<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
    Note over Admin,API: Flow 1: Upgrade readiness lint (read-only)
    Admin->>CLI: rhai-cli lint --target-version=3.x
    CLI->>API: Discovery + get DSC/DSCI (version detection)<br/>Auth: kubeconfig credentials
    API-->>CLI: Platform version, components
    CLI->>API: List/get component, dependency, workload CRs<br/>(client.Reader only)
    API-->>CLI: Resources
    CLI-->>Admin: table/json/yaml on stdout + exit code 0/1/2
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 225)
    Note over Admin,Trusty: Flow 2: Migration run (e.g. TrustyAI metrics)
    Admin->>CLI: rhai-cli migrate run [--dry-run] [--yes]
    CLI->>API: SelfSubjectAccessReview pre-flight (where implemented)
    API-->>CLI: allowed / denied
    CLI->>API: Find TrustyAI Route by label
    API-->>CLI: Route host
    CLI->>Trusty: GET/POST /metrics/...<br/>Auth: Bearer token from rest.Config<br/>TLS 1.2, NO cert verification
    Trusty-->>CLI: Metric definitions
    CLI->>API: Patch/create resources<br/>SPDY pod exec for data copy (HTTPS/SPDY)
    API-->>CLI: Result
    CLI-->>Admin: Migration report
    end

    rect rgb(235, 250, 235)
    Note over Admin,GH: Flow 3: Dependency install (hidden deps install)
    Admin->>CLI: rhai-cli deps install [--dry-run]
    alt Remote manifest
        CLI->>GH: GET odh-gitops manifest<br/>TLS (system trust), no auth
        GH-->>CLI: Manifest
    else Embedded
        Note over CLI: Use pkg/deps/data embedded chart
    end
    CLI->>API: Create Namespace, OperatorGroup,<br/>Subscription or ClusterExtension
    loop until Succeeded
        CLI->>API: Poll CSV status
        API-->>CLI: CSV phase
    end
    CLI-->>Admin: Install result
    end
